# Wren Cellar, for the interaction rules of the data copy that turns them on (interact nearby, running, battles aboard
# opening normally): the clerk is used across the counter in front of it, the notice from beside it, the table from
# either side of its two cells and the cook where it stands behind its counter. The notice opens the door, an exit drawn
# as floor while it is closed.

event cellar_clerk unskippable
	narrate @cellar.clerk.hello
	warp wren_cellar cellar_door
end

event cellar_notice unskippable
	narrate @cellar.notice.read
	set cellar.door_open
end

event cellar_table unskippable
	narrate @cellar.table.crumbs
end

event cellar_cook unskippable
	narrate @cellar.cook.stir
end
